title: Madonna
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

An important cultural figure since the late 70s. Madonna has been a recording artist, and actor, a human rights advocate, an activist. She's been at the top and the bottom of a variety of conversations related to artistic content, the right of artists to do and say what they wish, and really moved culture forward and pushed against boundaries. She's also been frequently the target of scandals, bad thinking, socio-cultural conservatism. If you care about music and culture, you should probably care about Madonna.

Personal note: My favorite Madonna album is [[Ray of Light]]